2T21:45:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117372481191239762"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/EdBVhzpGqg", "end": 151, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117372481191239762/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117372212650856448", "start": 128, "url": "https://t.co/EdBVhzpGqg"}]}, "id": "2117372481191239762", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 163, "impression_count": 70385, "like_count": 473, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 95, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "Opus 5.5: \"Give me 10 brilliant ideas for a science fiction short short story, pick the most brilliant and execute it terribly\" https://t.co/EdBVhzpGqg", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117372481191239762"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:42:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117371797674885139"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 263, "start": 255, "tag": "economy"}, {"end": 272, "start": 264, "tag": "markets"}, {"end": 279, "start": 273, "tag": "bonds"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/v7lrTWbejy", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117371797674885139/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117371642309390337", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/v7lrTWbejy"}]}, "id": "2117371797674885139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 80436, "like_count": 743, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 83, "retweet_count": 66}, "text": "I don't know about you, but I find it notable that the yield on 10-year US Treasuries barely moved lower on the day, closing at 4.91%, notwithstanding an 8% drop in oil prices and an intraday turnaround that saw the Nasdaq lose steam and close down 1.1%.\n#economy #markets #bonds https://t.co/v7lrTWbejy", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117371797674885139"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:13:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117364592309313626"], "id": "2117364592309313626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 20190, "like_count": 67, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "The definitive answers to how much the CA wealth tax would raise, read it before you vote!\n\nA great, transparent and useful use of AI-based policy analysis, you can choose your own assumptions and crosswalk the competing estimates from Fernando Hoces de la Guardia.", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2117364592309313626"}, {"author_id": "1161370756208648193", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:04:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117347203777974694"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 14, "start": 4, "tag": "FEDSPaper"}, {"end": 124, "start": 112, "tag": "EconTwitter"}], "urls": [{"description": "The Federal Reserve Board of Governors in Washington DC.", "display_url": "federalreserve.gov/econres/feds/h…", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/feds/heterogeneity-in-service-fee-sensitivity-evidence-from-atm-surcharges.htm", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117347205766074368/SIhLDbJq?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117347205766074368/SIhLDbJq?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 88, "status": 200, "title": "Heterogeneity in Service Fee Sensitivity: Evidence from ATM Surcharges", "unwound_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/feds/heterogeneity-in-service-fee-sensitivity-evidence-from-atm-surcharges.htm", "url": "https://t.co/9sWTBI3kx1"}]}, "id": "2117347203777974694", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1016, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New #FEDSPaper: Heterogeneity in Service Fee Sensitivity: Evidence from ATM Surcharges: https://t.co/9sWTBI3kx1 #EconTwitter", "url": "https://x.com/FedResearch/status/2117347203777974694"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:01:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117346417979384162"], "entities": {"urls":