two Bloomberg charts point to two dynamics influencing the global economic and market outlook:\n• Markets' ability to digest large government debt issuance without pushing rates to growth-inhibiting levels. \n• Investors' willingness to keep both equity and debt channels https://t.co/iEIx6GhZSN", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117333968848830708"}, {"author_id": "26538229", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:01:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117331383966183750"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The Federal Reserve Board of Governors in Washington DC.", "display_url": "federalreserve.gov/data/sloos.htm", "end": 135, "expanded_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/data/sloos.htm", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117555342351503360/OHLMLbAd?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117555342351503360/OHLMLbAd?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 112, "status": 200, "title": "Senior Loan Officer Opinion Survey on Bank Lending Practices", "unwound_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/data/sloos.htm", "url": "https://t.co/KFp6Dlt5eC"}]}, "id": "2117331383966183750", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 38785, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Now   available: quarterly survey on bank lending practices covering bank loans to   businesses and households: https://t.co/KFp6Dlt5eC", "url": "https://x.com/federalreserve/status/2117331383966183750"}, {"author_id": "68746721", "created_at": "2026-11-02T17:59:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117315680119013865"], "id": "2117315680119013865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 544, "impression_count": 139511, "like_count": 6150, "quote_count": 22, "reply_count": 189, "retweet_count": 208}, "text": "The most grating aspect of LLM writing is that it tries to turn every single sentence into a punchline, a witty slogan, with no regard fo